Package: mate-redshift
Architecture: any
Depends: rojo,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Night Light settings dialog for MATE
 mate-redshift is a settings dialog that configures and controls rojo, the
 MATE colour daemon that applies night light on both X11 and Wayland
 sessions. It sets colour temperature, schedule, location and transitions,
 offers a live preview, and can temporarily pause or force night light.
 .
 It can also import an existing redshift configuration and warns about other
 gamma-ramp tools (redshift, gammastep, wlsunset) that would conflict.
